        "text": "**Initiating Python Project**\n\nI'm now diving into the Python project, starting with a review of the `summarize_text.py` file to understand the existing structure. Following that, I'll be developing the other files, using Google Cloud as the external provider for the \"scored\" files, namely SAME-SCENARIO and LATER-STEP.\n\n\n**Defining Project Files**\n\nI've sketched out the Python files needed for the LLM integration, beginning with a detailed review of `summarize_text.py`. I'll build out `model_client.py` and `model_models.py` next. Then, I will address `extract_json.py`, `answer_with_context.py`, `stream_completion.py`, and `prompt_safety.py`. I'll be using Vertex AI for the LLM related integrations, and Google Cloud Translation for `result_translate.py` and Cloud Text-to-Speech API for `spoken_brief.py`. Finally, I will integrate `output_embedding.py`, using Vertex AI.\n\n\n",
