      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Model Structures**\n\nI'm now creating `model_models.py` to handle requests and responses. Right now, I'm focusing on text, and simple dictionary structures seem like the best approach for input and output, initially. I may move to something like Pydantic models in the future.\n\n\n**Establishing Data Structures**\n\nI've made progress on `model_models.py`, focusing on request and response structures. I'm starting with straightforward dictionary representations for text, messages, and responses. While Pydantic models are a possibility for later, dictionaries are sufficient to begin. I'm defining the basic text and message structures now.\n\n\n",
